  "Grit": "",
  "Deal Gun damage to random foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of Shun's Max HP ($1 hits), this has <link=\"s|220\"><u>[Guaranteed Critical]</u></link>. Each hit increases target's DMG Taken for $5 turns (based on Shun's Max HP, up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> at <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> Max HP). Stacks up to $6 times. Prioritze new targets and change damage to $7 for hits on the same target.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>A massive mark appears above foes, its metallic sheen emanating an awe-inspiring majesty. Justice descends, dealing Gun damage to foes.</color></size></b>": "",
  "High Noon Flag Lv.$1": "",
  "High Noon Flag <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Increase party's DMG Dealt for $3 turns (based on Shun's Max HP, up to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> at <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> Max HP). \\nIf there are $4 or more foes, additionally increase party's DMG Dealt for $7 turns (based on Shun's Max HP, up to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> at <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> Max HP).\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Heavy footsteps shake the earth, war flags snapping in the wind. Endless glory and bloody battles once unfolded here.</color></size></b>": "",
  "Daybreak Shot Lv.$1": "",
  "Daybreak Shot <color=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Grant 1 ally (other than Shun) [Sheriff Badge] for $1 turns. Only 1 ally can have [Sheriff Badge] at a time.\\nIncrease party's ATK (based on Shun's Max HP, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> at <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> Max HP). Also grant a shield to party equal to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> of Shun's Max HP + <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> and grant Shun a bonus shield equal to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> of Shun's Max HP + <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> for $8 turns.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>A single gunshot rings out. The bullet pierces that cloudy sky and the clouds recede like the tide, sunlight spills down upon him and his allies, leaving darkness with nowhere to hide.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Deal Gun damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of Shun's Max HP. Increase party's damage for $4 turns (based on Shun's Max HP, up to <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> at <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> Max HP).\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Gun damage to 1 foe.\\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe.\\nGun Attack: Deal Gun damage to all foes, this has Guaranteed Critical. Decrease Down Points of all targets that take damage by 1 regardless of affinities. Also, decrease target's DEF for 2 turns. Stacks up to 2 times. Can fire until out of ammo. After using a Gun Attack, Shun can use other skills.": "",
  "Increase Shield Effect by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>.\\nAfter a Shield Shun granted to himself ends, restore Shun's HP by $2 of remaining Shield.": "",
  "Increase Shield Effect by <color=#0169ca>$1</color>.\\nAfter a Shield Shun granted to himself ends, restore Shun's HP by $2 of remaining Shield.": "",
  "When dealing damage with a Gun Attack, increase target's DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> and Gun DMG Taken by <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> for $3 turns.": "",
  "When dealing damage with a Gun Attack, increase target's DMG Taken by <color=#0169ca>$1</color> and Gun DMG Taken by <color=#0169ca>$2</color> for $3 turns.": "",
  "Adverse Sacrifice": "",
  "In battle, Shun can grant allies [Sheriff Badge].\\n[Sheriff Badge]: Ally with [Sheriff Badge] have Null Down, if that ally would take fatal damage or lacks HP to use a skill, Shun will take that HP loss or spend that HP cost instead, up to $1 of that ally's Max HP.\\nShun's Gun Attack will deal Gun damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of Shun's Max HP and has [Guaranteed Critical]. Decrease Down Points of all targets that take damage by $3 regardless of affinities. Also, decrease target's DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> for $8 turns (up to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> DEF Down at <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> Max HP). Stacks up to $7 times. After using a Gun Attack, Shun can use other skills. Reload after Shun manually uses a Persona skill.": "",
  "In battle, Shun can grant allies [Sheriff Badge].\\n[Sheriff Badge]: Ally with [Sheriff Badge] have Null Down, if that ally would take fatal damage or lacks HP to use a skill, Shun will take all that HP loss or spend that HP cost instead, up to $1 of that ally's Max HP. When {{A}} activates this effect, if his current HP or the HP cost left from [Sheriff Badge] is less than the HP cost needed, this effect will not activate.\\nShun's Gun Attack will deal Gun damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of Shun's Max HP and has [Guaranteed Critical]. Decrease Down Points of all targets that take damage by $3 regardless of affinities. Also, decrease target's DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> for $8 turns (up to <color=#FFFC40>$6</color> DEF Down at <color=#FFFC40>$5</color> Max HP). Stacks up to $7 times. After using a Gun Attack, Shun can use other skills. Reload after Shun manually uses a Persona skill.": "",
  "Generous Support": "",
  "In battle, when an ally has [Sheriff Badge], increase party's Crit DMG by $1.\\nIncrease the HP loss or HP cost that Shun can take from [Sheriff Badge] by $2.": "",
  "Bonds between Friends": "",
  "At the start of Shun's turn, if an ally has [Sheriff Badge], automatically use [High Noon Flag]. This effect has a $1 turn cooldown.\\nEach hit from [Justice Shot] inflicts $2 bonus stacks of damage taken debuff.\\n[High Noon Flag]'s bonus damage buff is no longer limited by the number of foes. Also increase party's ATK by $3 more for $4 turns.": "",
