  "Stand with Honor": "",
  "Gain $2 Reserve Round stack when Shun spends $1 Ammo. When Shun has $3 or more Reserve Round stacks, he can enter [Suppressive Fire] mode and convert Reserve Round into Special Ammo for this turn, convert up to $4 Reserve Round stacks.\\nSpecial Ammo: When using a Gun Attack on foes, increase target's Downed DMG Taken by $5, DMG Taken by $6, and Crit DMG Taken by $7 for $8 turn. Stacks up to $9 times. Under [Suppressive Fire], the third Special Ammo will deal fixed damage equal to $10 of Shun's Max HP.": "",
